This '''species''' was a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that existed in [[the galaxy]]. [[Ubialla Gheal]] was a member of this species.<ref name="Wine in Dreams" />

==Biology and appearance==
This [[humanoid]] [[species]] was distinguished by their elongated craniums.<ref name="TLJ" />

==Species in the galaxy==
In [[34 ABY]],<ref name="Date Note">''[[Star Wars: Galactic Atlas]]'' places the events of [[Star Wars: Episode VII The Force Awakens|''Star Wars'': Episode VII ''The Force Awakens'']] in [[34 ABY]]. ''Star Wars'': Episode VIII ''The Last Jedi'' takes place immediately after the end of ''The Force Awakens''.</ref> a member of this species, [[Ubialla Gheal]], attended a party aboard [[Baron]] [[Yasto Attsmun]]'s yacht above the [[Sea of Cantonica]] near [[Canto Bight]] on the [[planet]] [[Cantonica]].<ref name="TLJ" />

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:Ubialla-Gheal-Concept-Art.jpg|thumb|right|200px|Concept art by Martin Rezard]]
The species made their onscreen debut in the [[2017]] film {{Film|VIII}}, directed by [[Rian Johnson]].<ref name="TLJ" /> They were originally designed by concept designer [[Martin Rezard]], with help from [[Heather McMullen]] and [[Neal Scanlan]].<ref name="Rezard">{{WebCite|url=https://martinrezard.com/|text=martin rezard|work=[https://martinrezard.com/ martin rezard]|archivedate=20250304031833}}</ref>

